<title>USA: Lincoln National Income Fund sets payout.</title>
<headline>Lincoln National Income Fund sets payout.</headline>
<dateline>FORT WAYNE, Ind. 1996-12-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lincoln National Income Fund Inc said Wednesday its directors voted a $0.62 per share dividend to be paid January 14, 1997, record December 31.</p>
<p>The payout is composed of the regular quarterly dividend of $0.28 per share, $0.25 per share in capital gains distribution and an additional distribution of $0.09 per share which represents accumulated undistributed net earnings for 1996.</p>
<p>Lincoln National Income Fund is a closed-end fund.</p>
<p>((-- Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787))</p>
</text>
